<title>HONG KONG: Tomei Int'l interim net loss HK$31.57 mln.</title>
<headline>Tomei Int'l interim net loss HK$31.57 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.74 loss  vs 5.06 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  49.43 loss vs 9.52 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    31.57 loss vs 38.67 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,052.69   vs 1,892.89</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tomei International (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Tomei International (Holdings) Ltd is a maker of consumer audio products and components.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$56.5 million from the disposal and closure of certain non-core and unprofitable businesses and a gain of HK$7.1 million resulting from the disposal of the non-core toys business.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
